link>P</reflink></lookup>; of lamp), <ref ref=\"Exod 28:29\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(2,28,29)\">Exod 28:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 28:30\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(2,28,30)\">Exod 28:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 28:38\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(2,28,38)\">Exod 28:38</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> of regular repetition: meals <ref ref=\"2Sam 9:7\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(10,9,7)\">2Sam 9:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 9:10\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(10,9,10)\">2Sam 9:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 9:13\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(10,9,13)\">2Sam 9:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 25:29\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(12,25,29)\">2Kgs 25:29</ref> = <ref ref=\"Jer 52:33\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(24,52,33)\">Jer 52:33</ref> journeys <ref ref=\"2Kgs 4:19\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(12,4,19)\">2Kgs 4:19</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Num 9:16\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(4,9,16)\">Num 9:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 71:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"71\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"71\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,71,3)\">Ps 71:3</ref> of ritual: sacrifice, <bdbheb>לַיּוֺם תָּמִיד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 29:38\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(2,29,38)\">Exod 29:38</ref> compare <ref ref=\"1Chr 16:40\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(13,16,40)\">1Chr 16:40</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 23:31\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(13,23,31)\">1Chr 23:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 24:14\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(14,24,14)\">2Chr 24:14</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> as substantive: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> of uninterrupted continuity, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אַנְשֵׁי ת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 39:14\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(26,39,14)\">Ezek 39:14</ref> <highlight>men of continuity</highlight>, i.e. men continually employed for the purpose; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לֶחֶם הַתּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 4:7\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(4,4,7)\">Num 4:7</ref> <highlight>the bread of continuity</highlight>, i.e. the bread that is always there, so <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מַעֲרֶכֶת ת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 2:3\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(14,2,3)\">2Chr 2:3</ref>, and perhaps <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>חֲצֹצְרוֺת ת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 16:6\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(13,16,6)\">1Chr 16:6</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> of regular repetition <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אֲרֻחַת מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 25:30\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(12,25,30)\">2Kgs 25:30</ref>, i.e. a regular allowance, = <ref ref=\"Jer 52:34\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(24,52,34)\">Jer 52:34</ref> especially of ritual: <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>קְטֹרֶת ת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 30:8\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(2,30,8)\">Exod 30:8</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); most often <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עֹלַת ת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 46:15\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(26,46,15)\">Ezek 46:15</ref> (every morning), <ref ref=\"Exod 29:42\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"42\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"42\" onclick=\"bcv(2,29,42)\">Exod 29:42</ref> (morning and evening, so) <ref ref=\"Num 28:6\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(4,28,6)\">Num 28:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 3:5\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(15,3,5)\">Ezra 3:5</ref>, so read also <ref ref=\"Num 28:3\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(4,28,3)\">Num 28:3</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup>) for <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MT')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ0</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עוֺלָה ת</bdbheb> (<bdbheb>לַיּוֺם</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עֹלַת הַת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 28:10\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(4,28,10)\">Num 28:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 28:15\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(4,28,15)\">Num 28:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 28:23\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(4,28,23)\">Num 28:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 28:24\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(4,28,24)\">Num 28:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 28:31\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(4,28,31)\">Num 28:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 29:6\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(4,29,6)\">Num 29:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 29:11\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(4,29,11)\">Num 29:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 29:16\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(4,29,16)\">Num 29:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 29:19\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(4,29,19)\">Num 29:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 29:22\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(4,29,22)\">Num 29:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 29:25\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(4,29,25)\">Num 29:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 29:28\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(4,29,28)\">Num 29:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 29:31\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(4,29,31)\">Num 29:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 29:34\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(4,29,34)\">Num 29:34</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 29:38\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(4,29,38)\">Num 29:38</ref> Neh <ref ref=\"Neh 10:35\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(16,10,35)\">Neh 10:35</ref> rarely <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִנְחַת ת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 4:16\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(4,4,16)\">Num 4:16</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Neh 10:34\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(16,10,34)\">Neh 10:34</ref> as appositive, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִנְחָה ת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 6:13\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(3,6,13)\">Lev 6:13</ref> <highlight>meal-offering as a regular observance</highlight> (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:131»§ 131</sup>, 2 (b) <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Da')\">Da<sup>Synt.§ 29</sup></lookup> (b); on text see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Now')\">Now<sup>Archaeology ii. 124 f.</sup></lookup>), (and <ref ref=\"Num 28:3\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(4,28,3)\">Num 28:3</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MT')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ0</reflink></bdbheb></lookup>, but see above) <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> (late) <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַת</bdbheb> alone = <highlight>daily</highlight> (morning and evening) <highlight>burnt-offering</highlight> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Now')\">Now<sup>Archaeology ii. 222 f.</sup></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Dan 8:11\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(27,8,11)\">Dan 8:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 8:12\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(27,8,12)\">Dan 8:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 8:13\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(27,8,13)\">Dan 8:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 11:31\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(27,11,31)\">Dan 11:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 12:11\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(27,12,11)\">Dan 12:11</ref> (so Talmud, even in plural <bdbheb>תְּמִידִין</bdbheb>). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Dan 12:11", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 12, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Eccl 45:14", "book": "ECC", "chapter": 45, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Hos 12:7", "book": "HOS", "chapter": 12, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Jer 6:7", "book": "JER", "chapter": 6, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Nah 3:19", "book": "NAM", "chapter": 3, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Isa 21:8", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 21, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Isa 49:16", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 49, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Isa 51:13", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 51, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Isa 52:5", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 52, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Isa 60:11", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 60, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Isa 62:6", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 62, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Isa 65:3", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 65, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Obad 1:16", "book": "OBA", "chapter": 1, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Hab 1:17", "book": "HAB", "chapter": 1, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Deut 11:12", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 11, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "1Kgs 10:8", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 10, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "2Chr 9:7", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 9, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "1Chr 16:11", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 16, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "1Chr 16:37", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 16, "verse": 37}, {"raw": "Ps 16:8", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 16, "verse": 8}, {"raw":